    "description": "THE WHY HOW DO COMPANY, Inc. provides smartphone services and solutions in Japan. The company develops smartphone platform solutions and IoT-related solutions; and handles social games, apps, commissioned game development, and other commissioned development projects. It also offers computer education for individuals and businesses; real estate leasing and subleasing; IT school seminars for job seekers; public vocational and corporate training; skills education in the areas of IT, web, and generative AI; employment support; fan club management; capsule toys, character products, and novelty items; tanning machines; health and beauty equipment; and temporary staffing and paid employment placement agency services. In addition, the company engages in the planning, production, and performance of various events, such as concerts, plays, performances, lectures, and sports events; music production; management, sale, and licensing of intellectual property rights; infrastructure construction and civil engineering works; paving, scaffolding, earthwork, concrete, and demolition works; wedding venue and accommodation facility operation; and sale and management of leak detection equipment. Further, it is involved in the manufacture, import, repair, maintenance, sale of measuring instruments for maintenance and inspection of social infrastructure, such as telecommunications, water supply, and electricity; sale, rental, and maintenance of LED lighting; applications for outdoor advertising; sign construction; management and administration of stores; development, sale, and wholesale of cosmetics and other products; wedding attire, wedding planning, restaurant, auberge glamping, and banquet/production services; and gold trading activities. The company was formerly known as Acrodea, Inc. and changed its name to THE WHY HOW DO COMPANY, Inc. in January 2022. THE WHY HOW DO COMPANY, Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan."
